message: "If you use or refer to this software in academic work, research, or other publications, please cite the project repository."
title: "WebOS"
version: "0.6"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OpenFiddles"
    affiliation: "WebOS project namespace"
repository-code: "https://gitlab.com/openfiddles/WebOS"
url: "https://web-os-iota.vercel.app"
license: "GPL-3.0-or-later"
abstract: >-
  WebOS is a browser-based desktop environment built with HTML, CSS,
  JavaScript, and browser APIs. It provides a desktop-style workspace,
  application windows, built-in tools, a browser-local virtual filesystem,
  and experimental JavaScript and WebAssembly application runtimes.
keywords:
  - browser-based desktop
  - web operating system
  - JavaScript
  - WebAssembly
  - virtual filesystem
